<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan tenders to buy Mar 1-15 unleaded reformate.</title>
<headline>Taiwan tenders to buy Mar 1-15 unleaded reformate.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has tendered to buy 250,000 barrels of 95-octane unleaded reformate for March 1-15 delivery, a company official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender seeks offers on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis to Keelung or Taichung by January 28. Offers should be valid until January 30.</p>
<p>CPC's last purchase of unleaded reformate was awarded to a Japanese trader at $27.00 per barrel c-and-f for delivery February 11-28.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
